{"Title":"Order relative to authorizing the joint committee on Revenue to make an investigation and study of certain current Senate documents relative to veterans exemptions and real estate transfer fees.\r\n\r\n","BillNumber":"S2930","DocketNumber":null,"GeneralCourtNumber":193,"PrimarySponsor":{"Id":"J26","Name":"Joint Committee on Revenue","Type":2,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/Committees/J26","ResponseDate":"2024-07-31T14:39:07.103"},"Cosponsors":[],"JointSponsor":null,"BillHistory":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/Documents/S2930/DocumentHistoryActions","LegislationTypeName":"Order","Pinslip":"Senate, July 31, 2024 -- The committee on Revenue, to whom was referred the petitions (accompanied by bill, Senate, No. 1811) of Ryan C. Fattman for legislation relative to 100% disabled veteran excise tax exemptions; (accompanied by bill, Senate, No. 1813) of Ryan C. Fattman for legislation relative to 100% disabled veteran motor vehicle tax exemptions; (accompanied by bill, Senate, No. 1930) of Michael F. Rush, Tackey Chan and Paul McMurtry for legislation to grant property tax relief to seniors; (accompanied by bill, Senate, No. 1960) of John C. Velis for legislation relative to uniformity among veteran tax exemptions; (accompanied by bill, Senate, No. 2419) of Julian Cyr and Sarah K. Peake (by vote of the town) for legislation to authorize the town of Wellfleet to establish a real estate transfer fee; and (accompanied by bill, Senate, No. 2466) of Julian Cyr and Sarah K. Peake (by vote of the town) for legislation to authorize the town of Provincetown to impose a 0.5% real estate transfer fee, report the accompanying Order  (Senate, No. 2930).","DocumentText":"\tOrdered, That the committee on Revenue be authorized and directed to make an investigation and study of certain current Senate documents numbered 1811, 1813, 1930, 1960, 2419, and 2466 relative to veterans’ exemptions and real estate transfer fees.\r\n","EmergencyPreamble":null,"RollCalls":[],"Attachments":[],"CommitteeRecommendations":[{"Action":"Study","FiscalAmounts":[],"Committee":{"CommitteeCode":"J26","GeneralCourtNumber":193,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/Committees/J26"},"Votes":[]},{"Action":"Discharge to Another Committee","FiscalAmounts":[],"Committee":{"CommitteeCode":"J40","GeneralCourtNumber":193,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/Committees/J40"},"Votes":[]}],"Amendments":[]}